                                                "sense_id": "23832a61-c8b3-3529-87a7-8e3d3b872ee5",
                                                "text": "A national hive mind has come to life on an open source Facebook group where hundreds of strangers trade tips on making respirator masks with baby wipes and paper towels, […]"
